// the control moves the arc of the template part `PART_Indicator` as the code of WinUI plays
// the compositions: the indeterminate composition loops over two seconds (the arc grows to
// half the ring and shrinks while it turns 900 degrees), and a determinate change plays the
// determinate composition from the old to the new value (two seconds for the whole ring), a
// decrease at once. The clock is the ring's `Clock`, or the global clock; the motion stops
// while the ring is inactive, hidden or out of the visual tree. `DeterminateSource` and
// `IndeterminateSource` (preview members of WinUI) are not ported. The Fluent and Simple
